export anchor DarkBrutalistStyle:
    number: 251
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark brutalist
    idea: Raw slabs on black with thick white borders, hard lime offset shadows, typewriter text and giant numbers, so the editor feels like a poster bolted together.
    base: dark
    palette:
        black: #000000, the page, buttons and the canvas
        slab: #111111, panel fill and the canvas grid lines
        white: #ffffff, text, 4px borders and inverted panel titles
        grey: #bdbdbd, small labels
        acid: #d4ff3a, slab shadows, the active tool, selected row, Share, frame border and the status band, under black text
        hot: #ff5ce1, the comment and focus
    type:
        Courier New, Courier, ui-monospace for text, and Arial Black,
        Helvetica Neue, Arial for display. Body 15px at 1.4. The file title
        40px 900 caps, inspector values 30px 900, panel titles 20px 900
        caps, labels and buttons 13 to 16px 700 caps, and the sheet title
        44px 900 caps.
    layout:
        Slabs with 4px white borders and hard lime shadows stack on black.
        The top row has a wide title slab with HOME V3 and WEBSITE REDESIGN
        slash slash CANVAS, a slab of three joined initials cells, Present
        and a lime Share. The left column stacks a three by two block of
        76px tools, each icon over a caps word, Move filled lime with an ON
        tag, then a ZOOM 66% bar and the layers slab with a white LAYERS
        title and 44px rows split by 2px rules, Hero filled lime with a
        boxed SELECTED tag. The canvas slab has a coarse 48px grid, a white
        HERO 1440 × 820 label and the white frame with a 4px lime border,
        lime square handles and a pink comment tilted two degrees with a
        hard pink shadow. The inspector slab is a grid of cells with giant
        values, X, Y, W, H, Fill, Auto layout, Gap, Padding, Corner radius
        and Export. A lime status band with black text and 4px dividers
        runs below. Below 1180px the inspector moves under the canvas.
        Below 760px only the canvas, the tool block and the band remain.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px between slabs, 8 to 12px inside cells.
    density: Low to medium. 56 to 76px targets and 30px values.
    corners: None. Every edge is square.
    borders: 4px white on every slab and cell, 2px between layer rows and 12px over the sheet.
    shadows: Hard 8px 8px lime on slabs and 6px white on buttons, never blurred. Pressed buttons drop their shadow.
    icons:
        22px line icons at 2.75px stroke with square caps above caps
        labels. Saved uses a check circle, editing two people and the
        version a tag, each with caps words on the lime band.
    focus: A 4px hot pink outline offset 4px, and a pink inset on inspector cells.
    tone: Blunt caps, such as HOME V3, ON and COLLAPSED.
